### 1. Create Cairo Branch
# @name createCairoBranch
POST http://localhost:3000/branch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "فرع القاهره",
  "code": "CAI-001",
  "address": "القاهره، وسط البلد"
}

### Create Cairo Inventory
@cairoBranchId = {{createCairoBranch.response.body.data.id}}
POST http://localhost:3000/inventory/branch/{{cairoBranchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "مخزن القاهره",
  "address": "القاهره، المنطقة الصناعية"
}

